OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FVery strong winds, peaking in
OL,6,Fthe morning but lasting throughout the
OL,7,Fday, which may be disruptive in the
OL,8,Fnorth. Mostly cloudy with some bright
OL,9,For sunny spells, but feeling cold in
OL,10,Fthe wind. Scattered showers, mainly
OL,11,Fover hills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers and strong winds will
OL,14,Fease for a time overnight. It will
OL,15,Fbecome steadily more unsettled during
OL,16,Fthe early hours as rain and strong
OL,17,Fgusts arrive in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
