OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FFeeling unpleasant during the
OL,6,Fmorning with strengthening winds under
OL,7,Fa band of persistent rain. Patchy rain
OL,8,Fand some brighter spells during the
OL,9,Fafternoon, but very strong winds and
OL,10,Fcoastal gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FOn
OL,13,FTuesday, very strong winds, coastal
OL,14,Fgales and scattered showers. The
OL,15,Fshowers and strong winds will ease
OL,16,Finto Wednesday for a bright, breezy
OL,17,Fday. Fine on Thursday with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
